{"slug":"skull-island-1xih7k","title":"Skull Island","titleEn":"Skull Island","type":"series","year":2023,"rating":6.5,"duration":45,"description":"Skull Island is an American animated adventure television series developed by Brian Duffield for Netflix. It is the fifth installment and the first television series of the Monsterverse franchise and a sequel to Kong: Skull Island (2017). The series was produced by Powerhouse Animation and Legendary Television with animation services provided by Studio Mir. Nicolas Cantu, Mae Whitman, Darren Barnet, Benjamin Bratt, and Betty Gilpin star in main roles as a group of shipwrecked explorers who find themselves on Skull Island in the 1990s, where they encounter giant-sized prehistoric creatures, including the island's self-appointed guardian Kong.","genres":["ماجراجویی","انیمیشن"],"poster":"/covers/tt13929756/poster.jpg","backdrop":"/covers/tt13929756/backdrop.jpg","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt13929756/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt13929756/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AzVEn9C0Ndw","director":"","cast":["Nicolas Cantu","Mae Whitman","Darren Barnet"],"country":"آمریکا","ageRating":"+13","quality":"HD","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":0,"views":0,"source":"f2m","addedAt":"2026-09-13T23:26:37.321Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://zz6rb5sa7t84cqpedeeqwjw5.abrtech.top/oG4i/Series/Skull.Island/S01/Skull.Island.S01E01.1080p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Subbed.Film2Media.mkv","sources":[],"thumbnail":"/api/cover/skull-island-1xih7k.svg"},{"season":1,"number":2,"name":"قسمت 2","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://zz6rb5sa7t84cqpedeeqwjw5.abrtech.top/oG4i/Series/Skull.Island/S01/Skull.Island.S01E02.1080p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","sources":[],"thumbnail":"/api/cover/skull-island-1xih7k.svg"},{"season":1,"number":3,"name":"قسمت 3","synopsis":"","duration":